4 marks)','XBC company has been listed at the Nairobi Securities Exchange (NSE). Outline four advantages of XBC company being listed on the NSE.','XBC company has been listed at the Nairobi Securities Exchange (NSE). Outline four advantages of XBC company being listed on the NSE.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:20','2026-08-12 04:56:20'),(126,6,5,NULL,5,'Question 5',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Outline four factors that can lead to business success.','Outline four factors that can lead to business success.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:21','2026-08-12 04:56:21'),(127,6,6,NULL,6,'Question 6',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Identify four reasons that may influence a consumer to satisfy basic wants before secondary wants.','Identify four reasons that may influence a consumer to satisfy basic wants before secondary wants.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:21','2026-08-12 04:56:21'),(128,6,7,NULL,7,'Question 7',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Jane is the personal secretary to the CEO of Mwangaza company. Outline four of her responsibilities in the company.','Jane is the personal secretary to the CEO of Mwangaza company. Outline four of her responsibilities in the company.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:22','2026-08-12 04:56:22'),(129,6,8,NULL,8,'Question 8',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','In the recent past, Kenya has been improving its infrastructure. Highlight four impacts of this on the transport sector.','In the recent past, Kenya has been improving its infrastructure. Highlight four impacts of this on the transport sector.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:23','2026-08-12 04:56:23'),(130,6,9,NULL,9,'Question 9',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','The following is the supply curve for product X in a week. Using the supply curve provided, derive the supply schedule for product X.','The following is the supply curve for product X in a week. Using the supply curve provided, derive the supply s