omote the new product.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:26','2026-08-12 04:56:26'),(137,6,16,NULL,16,'Question 16',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','State four internal sources of public finance.','State four internal sources of public finance.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:27','2026-08-12 04:56:27'),(138,6,17,NULL,17,'Question 17',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Highlight four factors that may facilitate a high rate of economic development.','Highlight four factors that may facilitate a high rate of economic development.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:27','2026-08-12 04:56:27'),(139,6,18,NULL,18,'Question 18',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','The following are types of taxes: corporate tax, customs duty, estate duty, and excise duty. Identify which type of tax matches each of the following statements.','The following are types of taxes: corporate tax, customs duty, estate duty, and excise duty. Identify which type of tax matches each of the following statements.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:28','2026-08-12 04:56:28'),(140,6,19,NULL,19,'Question 19',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Post the following information of a sales journal to the relevant ledger accounts.','Post the following information of a sales journal to the relevant ledger accounts.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:28','2026-08-12 04:56:28'),(141,6,20,NULL,20,'Question 20',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Outline four benefits of trade to the economy of Kenya.','Outline four benefits of trade to the economy of Kenya.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:29','2026-08-12 04:56:29'),(142,6,21,NULL,21,'Question 21',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Mr. Mutweri, a principal of Mutito School wants to inform the parents on the upcoming prize giving day event at the school. State four factors he should consider on the means of communication to use.','Mr. Mutweri, a principal of Mutito School wants to inform the parents on the upcoming prize giving day event at the school. State four factors he should consider on the means of communication to use.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:31','2026-08-12 04:56:31'),(143,6,22,NULL,22,'Question 22',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','State four external economies of scale that a firm may enjoy when operating on a large scale.','State four external economies of scale that a firm may enjoy when operating on a large scale.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:32','2026-08-12 04:56:32'),(144,6,23,NULL,23,'Question 23',NULL,4,'(4 marks)','Classify each of the following production activities as either primary, secondary, or tertiary.','Classify each of the following production activities as either primary, secondary, or tertiary.','{\"source\": \"openai_direct_review\"}','2026-08-12 04:56:33','2026-08-12 04:56:33');
